--- A page's declarations are set before its other top-level lines run, so
--- its top-level `seed[n]` runs before them: the facts' draws are seeded,
--- the same numbers on every run in both modes. They had been drawn
--- unseeded, a different number each run, and the two modes disagreed
--- (Rosetta Code, Create an HTML table; Vijay, 2026-10-29).
use ui, math

seed[2026]
x = rand[0, 9999]
rows = for i in range[3]
    rand[0, 99]
log[x]
log[rows]
